cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use face-rhythm in your research, please cite our preprint (see preferred-citation)."
title: "face-rhythm: Extracting rhythmic facial movements from video"
abstract: >
  A Python package for extracting rhythmic facial movements from video via
  non-negative tensor-component decomposition of optical-flow point-trajectory
  spectrograms.
type: software
authors:
